Here is the command you need to type into your terminal:

Bash
ssh tryhackme@10.10.x.x
Every component serves a specific purpose:

ssh: The program/binary you are executing. It acts as the SSH client.

tryhackme: The username of the account on the target machine you want to log into.

@: The separator meaning "at the host located at..."

10.10.x.x: The Target Machine IP Address displayed in the card at the top of your TryHackMe room.
